{"id":18,"slug":"18-article-va-section-khac-nhau-the-nao","category":"HTML","subcategory":"Semantic","level":"beginner","question_vi":"`<article>` và `<section>` khác nhau thế nào?","question_en":"How do `<article>` and `<section>` differ?","answer_vi":"`<article>` là nội dung **đứng riêng vẫn có nghĩa**; `<section>` là **một phần trong mạch nội dung của trang**.\n\n```html\n<article>                     <!-- một bài blog, đem đi nơi khác vẫn đọc được -->\n  <header><h2>Tiêu đề bài</h2></header>\n  <section><h3>Phần 1</h3>...</section>\n  <section><h3>Phần 2</h3>...</section>\n  <footer>Đăng ngày ...</footer>\n</article>\n\n<section>                     <!-- danh sách bình luận: cần context của bài -->\n  <h2>Bình luận</h2>\n  <article>...</article>     <!-- mỗi bình luận lại tự đứng được -->\n  <article>...</article>\n</section>\n```\n\n**Phép thử:** đem khối đó sang RSS feed hoặc site khác mà vẫn hiểu → `<article>`. Cần trang gốc mới hiểu → `<section>`.\n\nHai thẻ **lồng nhau được cả hai chiều**: article chứa section (chương mục của bài), section chứa article (danh sách card/comment).\n\n**Chốt:** card sản phẩm, tweet, comment, bài blog đều là `<article>` — không phải chỉ \"bài viết dài\" mới dùng được thẻ này.","answer_en":"`<article>` is content that **still makes sense on its own**; `<section>` is **a part of the page's flow**.\n\n```html\n<article>                     <!-- a blog post: readable anywhere -->\n  <header><h2>Post title</h2></header>\n  <section><h3>Part 1</h3>...</section>\n  <section><h3>Part 2</h3>...</section>\n  <footer>Published ...</footer>\n</article>\n\n<section>                     <!-- comment list: needs the post for context -->\n  <h2>Comments</h2>\n  <article>...</article>     <!-- each comment stands alone again -->\n  <article>...</article>\n</section>\n```\n\n**The test:** move the block into an RSS feed or another site — still understandable? `<article>`. Needs the original page? `<section>`.\n\nThe two nest **in both directions**: an article can hold sections (its chapters), a section can hold articles (a list of cards or comments).\n\n**Takeaway:** product cards, tweets, comments and blog posts are all `<article>` — the element is not reserved for long-form writing.","answer_html_vi":"<p><code>&lt;article&gt;</code> là nội dung <strong>đứng riêng vẫn có nghĩa</strong>; <code>&lt;section&gt;</code> là <strong>một phần trong mạch nội dung của trang</strong>.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">html</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"&lt;article&gt;                     &lt;!-- một bài blog, đem đi nơi khác vẫn đọc được --&gt;\n  &lt;header&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Tiêu đề bài&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;/header&gt;\n  &lt;section&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Phần 1&lt;/h3&gt;...&lt;/section&gt;\n  &lt;section&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Phần 2&lt;/h3&gt;...&lt;/section&gt;\n  &lt;footer&gt;Đăng ngày ...&lt;/footer&gt;\n&lt;/article&gt;\n\n&lt;section&gt;                     &lt;!-- danh sách bình luận: cần context của bài --&gt;\n  &lt;h2&gt;Bình luận&lt;/h2&gt;\n  &lt;article&gt;...&lt;/article&gt;     &lt;!-- mỗi bình luận lại tự đứng được --&gt;\n  &lt;article&gt;...&lt;/article&gt;\n&lt;/section&gt;\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">article</span>&gt;</span>                     <span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- một bài blog, đem đi nơi khác vẫn đọc được --&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">header</span>&gt;</span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">h2</span>&gt;</span>Tiêu đề bài<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">h2</span>&gt;</span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">header</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">section</span>&gt;</span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">h3</span>&gt;</span>Phần 1<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">h3</span>&gt;</span>...<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">section</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">section</span>&gt;</span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">h3</span>&gt;</span>Phần 2<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">h3</span>&gt;</span>...<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">section</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">footer</span>&gt;</span>Đăng ngày ...<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">footer</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">article</span>&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">section</span>&gt;</span>                     <span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- danh sách bình luận: cần context của bài --&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">h2</span>&gt;</span>Bình luận<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">h2</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">article</span>&gt;</span>...<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">article</span>&gt;</span>     <span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- mỗi bình luận lại tự đứng được --&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">article</span>&gt;</span>...<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">article</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">section</span>&gt;</span></code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\"><strong>Phép thử:</strong> đem khối đó sang RSS feed hoặc site khác mà vẫn hiểu → <code>&lt;article&gt;</code>. Cần trang gốc mới hiểu → <code>&lt;section&gt;</code>.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Hai thẻ <strong>lồng nhau được cả hai chiều</strong>: article chứa section (chương mục của bài), section chứa article (danh sách card/comment).</p><p class=\"qa-detail\"><strong>Chốt:</strong> card sản phẩm, tweet, comment, bài blog đều là <code>&lt;article&gt;</code> — không phải chỉ \"bài viết dài\" mới dùng được thẻ này.</p>","answer_html_en":"<p><code>&lt;article&gt;</code> is content that <strong>still makes sense on its own</strong>; <code>&lt;section&gt;</code> is <strong>a part of the page's flow</strong>.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">html</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"&lt;article&gt;                     &lt;!-- a blog post: readable anywhere --&gt;\n  &lt;header&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Post title&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;/header&gt;\n  &lt;section&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Part 1&lt;/h3&gt;...&lt;/section&gt;\n  &lt;section&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Part 2&lt;/h3&gt;...&lt;/section&gt;\n  &lt;footer&gt;Published ...&lt;/footer&gt;\n&lt;/article&gt;\n\n&lt;section&gt;                     &lt;!-- comment list: needs the post for context --&gt;\n  &lt;h2&gt;Comments&lt;/h2&gt;\n  &lt;article&gt;...&lt;/article&gt;     &lt;!-- each comment stands alone again --&gt;\n  &lt;article&gt;...&lt;/article&gt;\n&lt;/section&gt;\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">article</span>&gt;</span>                     <span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- a blog post: readable anywhere --&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">header</span>&gt;</span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">h2</span>&gt;</span>Post title<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">h2</span>&gt;</span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">header</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">section</span>&gt;</span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">h3</span>&gt;</span>Part 1<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">h3</span>&gt;</span>...<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">section</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">section</span>&gt;</span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">h3</span>&gt;</span>Part 2<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">h3</span>&gt;</span>...<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">section</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">footer</span>&gt;</span>Published ...<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">footer</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">article</span>&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">section</span>&gt;</span>                     <span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- comment list: needs the post for context --&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">h2</span>&gt;</span>Comments<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">h2</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">article</span>&gt;</span>...<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">article</span>&gt;</span>     <span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- each comment stands alone again --&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">article</span>&gt;</span>...<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">article</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">section</span>&gt;</span></code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\"><strong>The test:</strong> move the block into an RSS feed or another site — still understandable? <code>&lt;article&gt;</code>. Needs the original page? <code>&lt;section&gt;</code>.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">The two nest <strong>in both directions</strong>: an article can hold sections (its chapters), a section can hold articles (a list of cards or comments).</p><p class=\"qa-detail\"><strong>Takeaway:</strong> product cards, tweets, comments and blog posts are all <code>&lt;article&gt;</code> — the element is not reserved for long-form writing.</p>","references":[{"label":"MDN — <article>","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Reference/Elements/article"},{"label":"HTML Standard — the article element","url":"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/sections.html#the-article-element"}],"related":[{"url":"/q/16-semantic-html-la-gi-tai-sao-quan-trong","title":"Semantic HTML là gì? Tại sao quan trọng?"},{"url":"/q/17-su-khac-biet-giua-div-va-section-la-gi","title":"Sự khác biệt giữa `<div>` và `<section>` là gì?"},{"url":"/q/19-header-footer-nav-main-aside-dung-khi-nao","title":"`<header>`, `<footer>`, `<nav>`, `<main>`, `<aside>` dùng khi nào?"},{"url":"/q/20-figure-va-figcaption-dung-de-lam-gi","title":"`<figure>` và `<figcaption>` dùng để làm gì?"},{"url":"/q/21-mark-strong-em-khac-nhau-the-nao","title":"`<mark>`, `<strong>`, `<em>` khác nhau thế nào?"},{"url":"/q/22-the-time-duoc-su-dung-de-lam-gi","title":"Thẻ `<time>` được sử dụng để làm gì?"},{"url":"/q/23-semantic-html-anh-huong-seo-nhu-the-nao","title":"Semantic HTML ảnh hưởng SEO như thế nào?"},{"url":"/q/24-khi-nao-dung-dl-dt-dd","title":"Khi nào dùng `<dl>`, `<dt>`, `<dd>`?"}]}